nce":[{"id":"identity-six-20261024-q-7a02b3eee584f4d60486","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-227fec668c0a0c793450","layer":"original","quote":"轻财能施，善于交结。与诸葛瑾至厚，委庐江刘靖以得失，江夏李允以众事，广陵吴硕、河南张梁以军旅〖4〗：而倾心亲待，莫不自尽〖5〗。皎尝遣兵候〖6〗，获魏边将吏美女，以进皎。皎更其衣服，送还之，下令曰：“今所诛者曹氏，其百姓何罪？自今以往，不得击其老弱！”由是江淮间多归附者。","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-12e561ec2dd3b0556c79","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-5bf4e7d96e33d95524a0","layer":"original","quote":"奂以地主〖3〗，使所部将军鲜于丹，帅五千人先断淮道〖4〗；自帅吴硕、张梁五千人，为军前锋：降高城〖5〗，得三将","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-2b14df8d458f6db0cafc","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-5bf4e7d96e33d95524a0","layer":"original","quote":"拜扬威将军〖6〗，封沙羡侯；吴硕、张梁皆裨将军〖7〗，赐爵关内侯","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":119,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-3cdb448841c7fc47c073","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-95f1a2c3d10d2abaea0b","layer":"original","quote":"在事一年，遵皎旧迹；礼刘靖、李允、吴硕、张梁及江夏闾举等，并纳其善","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-bc981c242bda34c8493c","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-227fec668c0a0c793450","layer":"original","quote":"委庐江刘靖以得失，江夏李允以众事，广陵吴硕、河南张梁以军旅〖4〗：而倾心亲待，莫不自尽","section_title":"宗室传第六","sour